cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use modelscape in your research, please cite it.
type: software
title: modelscape
abstract: Behavioral testing for large language models. Modelscape changes one detail of a prompt at a time with checked perturbations, asks every variant repeatedly, and reports where answers change beyond run-to-run noise, set against the correct answer of every variant.
